---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<Base title='cats'>
  <div class='profile-card cats' data-label='MEET MY CATS'>
    <div class='cats-content'>
      <p class='cats-text'>
        i love my cats!!!<br />
        their names are <b>Nito</b> and <b>Mimishi</b>;<br />
        Nito being the tuxedo and Mimishi being the orange tabby, both are 10 years
        old.<br /><br />

        they don’t get along very well, it's like they are frenemies lol.<br
        /><br />

        <b>Nito</b> is grumpy but has a soft side. his favorite things are eating,
        sleeping and biting as a form of affection (or aggression lmfao). he’s well
        known in the neighborhood. he is very smart and gets what he wants. the thing
        he hates the most is his tail being touched. also he doesn’t like being picked
        up or hugged very much.<br /><br />

        <b>Mimishi</b> is a cutie pie but has an evil side lol. he likes to be around
        nature and sniffs everything. his favorite activity is rolling around looking
        for pets. he also likes rubbing against you and giving headbutts. he’s really
        a scaredy-cat haha. he doesn’t like loud noises or strangers. the thing he
        hates the most is water… and Nito.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class='profile-card gallery' data-label='CAT GALLERY'>
    <div class='cat-gallery'>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/nito1.jpg' alt='Nito' loading='lazy' />
        <p>nito being a handsome boy</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/nito2.jpg' alt='Nito' loading='lazy' />
        <p>chillin on the sofa</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/nito4.jpg' alt='Nito' loading='lazy' />
        <p>you always see the sky</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/nito5.jpg' alt='Nito' loading='lazy' />
        <p>so cute</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/nito6.jpg' alt='Nito' loading='lazy' />
        <p>insane face card</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/nito8.jpg' alt='Nito' loading='lazy' />
        <p>sleeping</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/nito9.jpg' alt='Nito' loading='lazy' />
        <p>eepy boy</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/nito10.jpg' alt='Nito' loading='lazy' />
        <p>employee of the month</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/mimi1.jpg' alt='Mimishi' loading='lazy' />
        <p>silly boy</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/mimi4.jpg' alt='Mimishi' loading='lazy' />
        <p>sun kissed</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/mimi5.jpg' alt='Mimishi' loading='lazy' />
        <p>why so cute</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/mimi6.jpg' alt='Mimishi' loading='lazy' />
        <p>zzzzz</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/mimi7.jpg' alt='Mimishi' loading='lazy' />
        <p>tongue out</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/mimi8.jpg' alt='Mimishi' loading='lazy' />
        <p>pretty boy</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/mimi9.jpg' alt='Mimishi' loading='lazy' />
        <p>a selfie</p>
      </div>
      <div class='cat-card'>
        <img src='/cats/mimi10.jpg' alt='Mimishi' loading='lazy' />
        <p>what's that?</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <style>
    .cat-gallery {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .cat-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cat-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--amber-dim);
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .cat-gallery {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .cats-text {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
